WEBVTT

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:14.830
<i>Open your eyes</i>

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.370
<i>Dwelling in the eyes of</i>
<i>that majestic figure are wishes</i>

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:24.950
<i>Let's sing to the sleepless night</i>

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:28.290
<i>Dramatically pull everything in,</i>
<i>even light and darkness</i>

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:31.700
<i>In order to smile again tomorrow, unafraid</i>

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:40.500
<i>I learned that true kindness is</i>
<i>actually solitude after looking at you</i>

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:47.000
<i>I wanted to get closer to your heart</i>
<i>and yet it's still so far away</i>

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.830
<i>No matter what fate gets in my way,</i>
<i>I'll face it head on</i>

00:00:53.830 --> 00:01:01.080
<i>With the bravery I chose with you,</i>
<i>let's flap our wings and fly</i>

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.370
<i>My heart is trembling with the hope that I found</i>

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:09.830
<i>Resounding inside me</i>
<i>move my heart</i>

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:13.290
<i>Lurking behind my hidden true motives</i>

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:16.750
<i>With a stronger gaze than anyone else</i>

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:20.040
<i>Dwelling in the eyes of</i>
<i>that majestic figure are wishes</i>

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:23.660
<i>Let's sing to the sleepless night</i>

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:26.830
<i>Dramatically pull everything in,</i>
<i>even light and darkness</i>

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:30.410
<i>In order to smile again tomorrow, unafraid</i>

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:32.040
<i>Let's begin</i>

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:34.040
<i>Open your eyes</i>

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:39.700
D-Demon Lord?!

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:47.910
Oh? What a rare intruder we have here today.

00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:54.700
"White Angel and Demon Lord"

00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:58.120
W-Were you...

00:01:58.120 --> 00:01:59.330
"Angel White"

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:01.700
...waiting to ambush me or something?

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:03.620
"Hakuto Kunai"

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:07.080
This is a sacred place called an outdoor bath.

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:11.250
The only ones who cause a ruckus here
are kids who don't know better...

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:13.450
...and uncivilized fools.

00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:16.790
I want to believe you fall
into neither of those groups.

00:02:19.540 --> 00:02:23.870
Calm down, me! If I inadvertently
make her scream or shriek,

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:28.410
not only will my reputation crumble,
but my name will be ruined!

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:31.370
Take riding on a crowded train, for example.

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:32.870
Why is it, that without any damn reason at all,

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:35.830
"I'm telling you it wasn't me"
Why is it, that without any damn reason at all,

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:38.580
guys are instantly made the bad guy?

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:48.250
I won't be jailed for a dumb reason
like ogling at a Holy Maiden, will I?

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:59.540
Shit! Why does trouble like this
always follow me when I take a bath?!

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:02.620
And what's a Holy Maiden
doing in this village anyways?

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:05.330
Plus, isn't this the men's bath?

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:10.000
--Could it be a honey trap or something?!
--Sister!

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.870
What are you looking at?!

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:16.660
Wait... Even if it's possible they
set up a trap like that for me,

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:22.500
there's no way a woman who's the pinnacle
of the kingdom would take part in it.

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:28.160
If you've come all this way to find me,
I imagine it's for something important.

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:33.290
And believe it or not, I'm quite proud
of being able to lend an ear.

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:36.540
Something important? It's all because you--

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:38.500
Before that...

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:41.040
This appearance of yours is taxing for me.

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:44.580
I recommend you use this.

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:59.580
W-Were you staring at my naked body?!

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:03.160
How about you dip yourself in the bath already?

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:08.120
If someone as vital as you catches a cold,
it would be bad for the kingdom.

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:18.540
Th-This is the first time a man
has seen me naked...

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:23.870
And what's more, he said seeing me was taxing?!

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:28.080
Now then, let's hear this
important business of yours.

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:33.290
I-Is he saying my naked body
isn't even worth looking at?

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:36.120
D-Demon Lord, it's bad enough that Mada--

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:43.870
What's the matter, Holy Maiden White?

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:47.870
Surely the representative of your kingdom
wouldn't be so adorable...

00:04:47.870 --> 00:04:52.580
...as to be shaken by the sight of a naked man.

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:55.790
N-No... It doesn't... It doesn't matter.

00:04:55.790 --> 00:05:01.370
It's no big deal. It's not like it's some
indecent crime to see a man naked.

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:05.290
Th-This is the first time I've seen
a naked man in my life.

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:12.000
And for it to be Demon Lord
of all people, the root of all evil...

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.950
O-Oh?

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:18.410
As a matter of fact, seeing your
naked body means nothing to me.

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:20.750
Well isn't that splendid.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:24.700
That means we can have a nice,
calm conversation then.

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:29.370
What are you trying to do to
this kingdom by deceiving Madam?

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:33.620
Deceiving people doesn't sound
like a calming topic to me.

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:39.120
Both Luna and Madam wish to stay
in the village of their own volition.

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:42.250
I'm not forcing anyone to do anything.

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:51.080
Give me one good reason
I should believe that! Go on!

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:54.000
I'd appreciate if you came no closer.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:57.870
That body of yours is
rather stimulating, you know.

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:03.700
J-Just how much do you plan to
insult me until you're satisfied?!

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:09.790
You're mistaken. I'm completely
serious in everything that I say.

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:13.120
This mouth of mine speaks only the truth.

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:17.290
Y-You have the nerve to say
that you're speaking the truth?!

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:21.660
As far as Madam is concerned, I do.

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:26.290
This bath here should answer
some of your questions.

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:29.450
How can a bath answer my questions?

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:33.870
Calm your heart and sink in
to your shoulders at least.

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:49.080
That's better. Wherever there's light,
there's always shadow too.

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:52.540
My mind is blank. I'm filled with nothingness.

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:56.790
This bath... is like...

00:06:58.410 --> 00:06:59.500
My shoulders!

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:06.580
Hey, quit with the funny sounds!
And stop using such a cute voice!

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:15.160
Wh-What's happening to me?

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:18.500
This is... a first for me!

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:21.580
Gah! You're doing it on purpose!

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:29.450
This outdoor bath helps with
more than just exhaustion.

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:33.540
It also helps set you free from everyday life.

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:37.410
You'll forget all your troubles
and feel released for a time.

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:42.580
It also restores your strength and
gives you the vigor to face tomorrow.

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:46.790
Sets you free... from everyday life?

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:52.330
The pleasantness you're experiencing
now is the answer to everything.

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:56.120
A-Are you telling me to drink this?

00:07:56.120 --> 00:08:01.540
Are you so scared by a drink from
the Demon Lord that you refuse to drink it?

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:05.950
The cautiousness and cowardice
from you as this kingdom's pinnacle...

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:11.040
...is one of the reasons this
land is in such disarray.

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:15.120
Y-You have no right to say
anything like that to me.

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:20.040
Besides, if you think you can poison
me with this drink, you're mistaken.

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:21.450
"Angel's Spoon"
Angel's Spoon.

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:30.410
If you ask me, the only poison in this
kingdom is the very people running it.

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:37.160
They care not of the masses
who live miserable lives...

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:39.660
...and turn their backs on them.

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:42.580
What's more, they do nothing
to fix the situation...

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:46.700
...and construct not a single plan
to reach out and help.

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:52.250
In my country, people such as this...

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:53.700
...we call incompetent.

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:57.370
I can't even argue...

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:05.830
From your perspective,
I suppose it seems that way.

00:09:05.830 --> 00:09:09.540
Seeing a young woman like me
just spinning her wheels...

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:11.910
...must seem ridiculous.

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:16.450
A woman of her beauty could
be called no less than a femme fatale.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:19.540
Rather, to put it in this world's terms,

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:22.250
I suppose you'd call her an angel.

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:31.250
"Japanese Sake"
"Restores +10 Power."
This is an alcohol from my country.

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:33.830
"Japanese Sake"
"Restores +10 Power."
It's been loved by many for countless years.

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:39.830
Indirect...

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:46.620
Indirect kiss? Are you a child or something?
What is this nonsense?

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:48.160
I'm so sorry.

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:51.040
How's it go again?

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:53.700
I pray my big sister isn't always unwanted.

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:58.410
Sorry that I'm so unwanted.

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:00.950
I am a child! Is that so wrong?!

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:05.580
N-No, I'm not saying it's bad or anything.

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:09.830
Rather, women who act innocent
are typically well liked.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:12.700
Isn't that something you can be proud of?

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:15.580
How can I be proud of something like that?!

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:18.410
You're laughing and making fun of me!

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:20.540
I'm not making fun of you.

00:10:20.540 --> 00:10:24.540
In fact, it's impressive you're that hardheaded.

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:27.330
Both you and Queen say I'm so hardheaded!

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:30.080
What am I, some sort of golem?!

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:34.540
Gah! I stepped on a landmine!
There's no recovering it now!

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:36.000
Now that it's come to this...

00:10:38.410 --> 00:10:39.830
"Angel's Halo"
"Defense +2"

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:42.750
Wh-What in the world is that?

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:46.160
This is something I'd like
to give you as a gift.

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:48.910
For not besmirching the Holy Maiden name.

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:58.080
Devote yourself as to not
bring shame to this halo.

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:00.700
And know that I am not your enemy.

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:13.700
An Angel's Halo?

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:16.410
Why would a Demon Lord have this?

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:21.910
"Fallen Angel Lucifer" "Race: God" "Sex: ?"
"Age: ?" "Height: ?"

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:26.910
"Akira Oono" "Race: Human" "Sex: Male"
"Age: 30s" "Height: ?"

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:30.330
This is the same as any trip.

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:33.450
Getting everyone home safe is the primary goal.

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:40.290
She's still wearing it?
Well, I guess it suits her...

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:45.540
Holy Maiden White.
Did you travel to this village by carriage?

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:47.330
N-No...

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:49.540
By yourself then?

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:51.000
Yes...

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:56.580
No matter who it may be, I cannot speak
of the Seraph's Miracles to anyone.

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:03.540
I see. In that case,
I'll show you to the Holy Castle.

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:06.660
Huh? What do you mean by--

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:10.290
U-Um, what exactly are you doing?

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:14.450
There's nothing at all to worry about.

00:12:14.450 --> 00:12:17.000
Just entrust everything to me.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:20.540
Um, are you going to--

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:22.290
Quiet.

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:26.290
In times like this, silence is golden.

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:29.290
O Wings, carry me afar!

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:31.410
Instant Movement: Holy Castle!

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:38.790
That was the same as Seraph's Bound!

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:43.750
A Miracle! That had to be the act of an angel!

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:46.830
Wh-What exactly are you?

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:50.620
I believe I told you something
regarding that before.

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:56.040
How seeing something in person
is better than having it explained to you.

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:03.160
Now you're home again, safe and sound.

00:13:03.160 --> 00:13:06.790
That alone is more important than anything else.

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:12.580
Just so we're clear, you're to tell nobody
about what happened today.

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:13.580
Right.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:19.830
Even if he didn't say that,
I wouldn't dare talk about it with anyone.

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:26.040
If this ever got out, the kingdom
might erupt into pure chaos.

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:31.410
That a Miracle left behind by the Seraph
could be used by somebody else...

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:34.830
That there exists someone
who can bestow others a halo...

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:38.580
...when it was thought only
angels could wear them.

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:41.450
Who in the world are you anyways?

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:48.250
Someone, who in the future,
would appreciate your cooperation.

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:53.200
Like I mentioned before,
I'm hoping to learn more about the Seraph.

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:56.160
But why the Seraph?

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:58.330
Because I...

00:13:58.330 --> 00:14:01.580
...am someone who was called here by the Ophan.

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:04.790
By the Ophan?!

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:06.910
If what he just told me is true,

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:10.870
so many pieces of the puzzle come together!

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:13.290
It explains why she's so drawn to him,

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:20.250
despite being a bundle of selfishness
and her deep devotion to the Cherub.

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:24.830
Even Madam, who's so tough to deal with,
moved away from the interior...

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:31.290
And how he can use Miracles,
just like the Seraph!

00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:34.540
It answers why he can give
people an Angel's Halo...

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:37.080
...when something like that
should be impossible.

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:41.290
And that mysterious building too...

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:52.160
Are you someone who plans
on opposing the Seraph?

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:56.330
I want you to know that was never my intention.

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:59.040
I just wanted to ask them a couple of questions.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:04.160
Um...

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:12.500
As I thought, an Angel's Halo looks good on you.

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:18.200
Let's meet again,

00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:20.040
Holy Maiden White!

00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:33.660
Lucifer...

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:38.120
According to the legends, he was known
as a fallen angel and demon lord.

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:42.000
Angel's Halo...

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:44.700
I can't imagine the one who made this...

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:48.200
...is an evil being in any shape or form.

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:58.200
Someday, I'll help you revert
to the angel you are...

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:11.540
Demon Lord, there you are!

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:13.200
"Aku"
Demon Lord, there you are!

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:16.040
Aku, huh? It's good to see you.

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:23.160
Listen, Aku.

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:25.200
This might be fine right now,

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:28.700
but learn to keep more distance
between yourself and men.

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:33.330
Your complete disregard of caution
is going to worry me sick.

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:37.450
I don't even think about getting
close to other men than you.

00:16:37.450 --> 00:16:40.910
Oh, really? I suppose it's fine then.

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:41.910
Yeah!

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:50.000
Is it true you're going on a trip
up north starting tomorrow?

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:54.870
While that's true, I always have
Instant Movement if I need it.

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:59.910
A trip I can return from at any time
can hardly be called a trip.

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:02.830
Right... But I'll be lonely.

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:08.200
If I see anything neat,
I'll grab you it as a souvenir.

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:10.250
Look forward to when I come back.

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:12.200
Demon Lord...

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:15.660
Please come home safe, okay?

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:19.500
Who do you think I am?

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:24.120
Aku? Where in the world are you?!

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:26.330
"Tron"
Luna won't shut up.

00:17:26.330 --> 00:17:29.500
If you're looking for Aku, she's here on my lap.

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:31.660
"Luna Elegant"
Y-You...!

00:17:31.660 --> 00:17:36.580
You pervert! My butt isn't enough for you,
so you go for Aku's too?!

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:40.120
By the way, I forgot to mention something.

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:44.000
I took your sister back to the Holy Castle.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:48.040
D-Don't tell me you got your
claws into my sister too?!

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:53.080
I'm tired, so let's sleep soon.

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:08.750
Why did it end up like this?

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:22.750
How the hell am I supposed to sleep?!

00:18:22.750 --> 00:18:24.830
You've got to be kidding me!

00:18:31.160 --> 00:18:34.080
"Isami Tahara" "Yu Kirino"
Yu, I'm leaving you in charge of the hospital.

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:37.120
"Isami Tahara" "Yu Kirino"
Do what you can to build our reputation.

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:40.790
Certainly. Leave everything to me.

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:41.830
Chief?

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.160
Your tie...

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:52.870
Tahara, the village itself
will be in your hands.

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:57.870
If there's an emergency,
send me a message any time.

00:18:57.870 --> 00:19:04.080
Roger that. But I don't plan on
needing to bug you with any trouble.

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:11.910
The village is changing.

00:19:11.910 --> 00:19:17.120
Having taken things this far,
there's no choice but to go all the way.

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:19.950
I have more to protect now.

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:25.580
And in order to protect them,
I need to become even stronger.

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:28.540
Unless I overcome my weak point of magic,

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:32.290
someday it will surely be used against me.

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:35.620
Tahara, I have one more order for you.

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:41.080
If anyone approaches and intends
to harm the village,

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:45.040
erase them. Leave none alive. Got it?

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:47.620
Understood.

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:51.040
Let's go.

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:54.750
"Mikan" "Yukikaze"
The old man sure is impatient.

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:56.910
"Mikan" "Yukikaze"
Let's get a move on!

00:19:56.910 --> 00:20:01.200
Yeah, yeah. You're just happy
that Demon Lord's here. Hiyah!

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:07.790
You know what? I'm not sure why, but...

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:10.790
I just had a thought that takes me back.

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:12.830
And what's that?

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:16.250
I remembered the very first day I met Chief.

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:17.790
That sounds interesting.

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:23.660
There's not really much to say about it.

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:26.200
Just, at the time...

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:29.950
If I had refused the Chief's invitation,

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:32.200
I probably would have died.

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:38.660
I can't even hold a candle to the guy.

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:40.450
Of course you can't.

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:44.080
Compared to the Chief,
you're nothing but a paramecium.

00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:48.580
Come on. Can't you make any
better comparisons than that?

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:52.910
Chief... Won't you please come home soon?

00:20:52.910 --> 00:20:54.540
He just left though!

00:20:57.410 --> 00:21:01.290
The city of Rookie is where
the Prison Dungeon is, huh?

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:19.620
<i>"I wish I could go back"</i>

00:21:19.620 --> 00:21:22.370
<i>Is what someone said</i>

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:27.160
<i>But I don't have a past</i>

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:30.160
<i>For eternity</i>

00:21:30.160 --> 00:21:32.660
<i>That nothing would change</i>

00:21:32.660 --> 00:21:37.410
<i>Is what I thought</i>

00:21:37.410 --> 00:21:40.200
<i>Over and over </i>

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:43.540
<i>Rubbing my eyes to make sure</i>

00:21:43.540 --> 00:21:47.620
<i>I'm overwhelmed by emotion</i>

00:21:47.620 --> 00:21:50.870
<i>Like a lie</i>
<i>Bright! Still locked up</i>

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:53.750
<i>Hiding what I couldn't give up</i>

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:57.910
<i>That miracle lit up by my heart</i>

00:21:57.910 --> 00:22:01.120
<i>Not sought out, not doubted</i>

00:22:01.120 --> 00:22:04.080
<i>But still you believed</i>

00:22:04.080 --> 00:22:08.500
<i>As if to teach me</i>

00:22:08.500 --> 00:22:14.330
<i>RE NEW ME</i>
<i>Now that I'm laughing with you</i>

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:21.250
<i>I can embrace it all</i>

00:22:21.250 --> 00:22:27.000
<i>Once again</i>

00:22:38.250 --> 00:22:40.950
So this here is Rookie, huh?

00:22:40.950 --> 00:22:44.200
Seems pretty prosperous, wouldn't you say?

00:22:44.200 --> 00:22:46.540
Let's explore the Prison Dungeon already...

00:22:46.540 --> 00:22:49.120
...and get whatever item you're looking for.

00:22:49.120 --> 00:22:53.000
Old man! Let's prison love
in the Prison Dungeon!

00:22:53.000 --> 00:22:57.330
Hey! The heroes came back this year!

00:22:57.330 --> 00:22:58.700
What heroes?!

00:23:01.330 --> 00:23:05.080
"The White Tri-Stars"

00:23:05.330 --> 00:23:09.500
"The White Comet
Hero, Otamega"

00:23:11.950 --> 00:23:14.120
Wha...?!

00:23:14.450 --> 00:23:15.790
"To be continued!"
To be continued!
